Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Portal Settings|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Edit Default User Associations Organization Sites
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|CPPortalSettings#EditDefaultUserAssociationsOrganizationSites|
	When ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And Organization add CP
		|orgName|Organization Name|
		|orgType|Organization|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And UsersAndOrganizationsNavigator goto Organizations
	And Organization add Site CP
		|orgName|Organization Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Instance Settings|
	And PortalSettings edit Configuration Users Default User Associations Organization Sites CP
		|orgName|Organization Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Instance Settings|
	And PortalSettings view Configuration Users Default User Associations Organization Sites CP
		|orgName|Organization Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User add CP
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User goto Edit CP
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	Then User view User Infomation Organization Sites CP
		|orgName|Organization Name|
		|siteName|Organization Name|
