Scenario: View Content Sharing Disabled Across Sites Via AP
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|CPPortalSettings#ViewContentSharingDisabledAcrossSitesViaAP|
	When ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Instance Settings|
	And PortalSettings configure Content Sharing Across Sites CP
		|enableAcrossSite|false|
	And PortalSettings configure Content Sharing Sub Sites CP
		|subSites|enabledByDefault|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site add Blank CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site add Blank CP
		|parentSiteName|Site Name|
		|siteName|Child SiteName|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Page add
		|pageName|AP Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Asset Publisher|
	And Page add
		|pageName|WC Test Page|
		|siteName|Child SiteName|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Child SiteName|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Web Content Display|
	And WebContent add PG Via WCD
		|webContentContent|WC WebContent Content|
		|webContentTitle|WC WebContent Title|
	And WebContent view PG Via WCD
		|webContentContent|WC WebContent Content|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And AssetPublisherPortlet configure Site Scope PG
		|siteName|Child SiteName|
		|siteScopeType|Child Site|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And AssetPublisherPortlet view Configure Site Scope Content Sharing PG
		|childSite|true|
		|contentSharingAcrossSitesEnabled|false|
		|globalSiteName|Global|
		|globalSiteType|Global|
		|liferaySiteName|Liferay|
		|liferaySiteType|Site|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And AssetPublisherPortlet view Content Sharing PG
		|assetContent|WC WebContent Content|
		|assetTitle|WC WebContent Title|
		|siteScope1|Site Name|
		|siteScope2|Child SiteName|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Blogs add Via AP Select Scope
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
		|siteScope|Site Name|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Child SiteName|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Asset Publisher|
	And AssetPublisherPortlet configure Site Scope PG
		|siteName|Site Name|
		|siteScopeType|Parent Site|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And AssetPublisherPortlet view Configure Site Scope Content Sharing PG
		|childSite|true|
		|contentSharingAcrossSitesEnabled|false|
		|globalSiteName|Global|
		|globalSiteType|Global|
		|liferaySiteName|Liferay|
		|liferaySiteType|Site|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Child SiteName|
	Then AssetPublisherPortlet view Content Sharing PG
		|assetContent|Blogs Entry Content|
		|assetTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
		|siteScope1|Site Name|
		|siteScope2|Child SiteName|
Scenario: View Content Sharing Enabled Across Sites Via AP
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|CPPortalSettings#ViewContentSharingEnabledAcrossSitesViaAP|
	When TestCase get Site Name
##########################################################
The Poshi return element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
		|siteName|${siteName}|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Instance Settings|
	And PortalSettings configure Content Sharing Across Sites CP
		|enableAcrossSite|true|
	And PortalSettings configure Content Sharing Sub Sites CP
		|subSites|enabledByDefault|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site add Blank CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Page add
		|pageName|AP Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Asset Publisher|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And AssetPublisherPortlet view Configure Site Scope Content Sharing PG
		|contentSharingAcrossSitesEnabled|true|
		|globalSiteName|Global|
		|globalSiteType|Global|
		|liferaySiteName|${siteName}|
		|liferaySiteType|Site|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Blogs add Via AP
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
	And Navigator open URL
	And Page add
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
		|pageName|AP Test Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Asset Publisher|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|AP Test Page|
	And AssetPublisherPortlet view Configure Site Scope Content Sharing PG
		|contentSharingAcrossSitesEnabled|true|
		|currentSite|true|
		|globalSiteName|Global|
		|globalSiteType|Global|
		|liferaySiteName|Liferay|
		|liferaySiteType|Current Site|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|AP Test Page|
	And AssetPublisherPortlet configure Add Site Scopes
		|otherSite|Site Name|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|AP Test Page|
	Then AssetPublisherPortlet view Content Sharing PG
		|assetContent|Blogs Entry Content|
		|assetTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
		|siteScope1|Site Name|
		|siteScope2|${siteName}|
